**Security decisions implemented:**
- Database client initialized server-side only, never exposed to client
- All analytics queries filter by authenticated user ID from session
- Row Level Security enforced at database level with per-operation policies
- API endpoint authenticates before querying, validates input with Zod
- Client widget fetches via authenticated API endpoint, no direct DB access
- UUIDs used for identifiers, no sequential integers exposed
